  "detail_text": "DLA Land and Maritime is preparing to solicit a long-term contract (LTC) for the below NSN. The purpose of this notice is to identify qualified vendors capable of manufacturing or distributing the item in accordance with the listed requirements. Sources interested in submitting a proposal on the upcoming solicitation should complete the attached Market Research Questionnaire and Spreadsheet . National Stock Number (NSN): 4720-00-540-1962 Item Name: HOSE, NONMETALLIC AMC: 1 AMSC: T NAICS: 326220 Unit of Measure: FT Estimated ADQ: 17,900 QPL Source: Parker Hannifin Corp. Pneutronics CAGE: 98441 PART PIECE NUMBER: M5593-4 QPL Source: Danfoss Power Solutions II CAGE: 53713 PART PIECE NUMBER: M5593-4 Submit the Market Research Questionnaire and Spreadsheet to Kimberly Pozderac at kimberly.pozderac@dla.mil, by Thursday May 7th, 2026 . Thank you in advance for your assistance, Kim Pozderac, Contract Specialist DLA Land and Maritime – ZCB kimberly.pozderac@dla.mil",
